     C                   MOVEL(P)  KDEWBIBL      DSBIBL                         DURCH ...'
     C                   MOVEL(P)  KDEWUSER      DSUSER                         FÜLLEN
     C                   Z-ADD     KDEWJZEI      DSJZEI
     C                   Z-ADD     KDEWJDAT      DSJDAT
     C*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
